  m_Name: ArtStudio1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Question
  questionText: Tell me about yourself
  largeQuestionBox: 0
  conversation:
  - "Oh, well. What\u2019s there to say..."
  - "I\u2019m Gemini. I run the\u2013 uh, <i>this</i> art shop."
  - "I also take commissions, or at least I usually do. I\u2019ve been a little swamped
    lately."
  - "<color=notiCol>All my time\u2019s been spent on a sculpture for the mayor.</color>
    A \u2018to scale\u2019 rendition, and he\u2019s been rather diff\u2013 uh, <i>pedantic</i>,
    about it."
  - "He wanted to make sure it was truly \u2018reflective of his image\u2019 after
    the work he\u2019d had done."
  - "...Oh dear, don\u2019t tell him I said that."
  - Anyway, I only just got it in the kiln last night.
  - "<color=notiCol>I was supposed to deliver it to his office this morning</color>,
    before\u2014 you know, all of... <i>this</i>."
  - "<color=notiCol>I can\u2019t complain though when he\u2019s the one who actually
    set me up with the kiln. Uh, <i>new</i> kiln, that is.</color>"
  - The old one was, well, <i>old</i>, and there were problems with using the gas.
